OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is the Henry Nowak case still
OL,4,Abeing investigated?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, Vickrum Digwa was
OL,7,Fjailed for life with a minimum term of
OL,8,F21 years for the murder of 18-year-old
OL,9,Fstudent Henry Nowak.
OL,11,FDigwa fatally stabbed Nowak, then
OL,12,Ffalsely claimed he had been racially
OL,13,Fabused and had acted in self-defence.
OL,15,FHis sentencing could have concluded the
OL,16,Finvestigation into Nowak's tragic
OL,17,Fdeath, which occurred in Southampton on
OL,18,F3 December 2025.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
