OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is the Henry Nowak case still
OL,4,Abeing investigated?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut on Monday, Nowak's parents welcomed
OL,7,Fan announcement by the Home Secretary
OL,8,Fof an independent review into the
OL,9,Fmurder, which will be led by former
OL,10,FJustice Secretary Alex Chalk KC.
